  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees.",
    "In a large bowl, combine the mashed soya beans, malt syrup, chopped candy pieces, rolled oats, vegetable oil, turmeric, ginger, and salt.",
    "Mix all the ingredients together until well combined.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a baking dish and smooth the top.",
    "Bake the casserole in the preheated oven for 35 minutes.",
    "Remove the casserole from the oven and let it cool for a few minutes.",
    "Serve the casserole warm, garnished with additional candy pieces if desired.",
    "Store any leftovers in an airtight container in the refrigerator for up to 3 days."
